Calculated files are placed into CALCULATIONS_DIR */home/willow/prj/amax/amax-calculations).

Time range is now fixed; e.g. for 2023 startDay=2022-10-01, endDay=2023-12-31 (therefore month=-3)

1. Calculate ephemeris
	perl geoCoord.pl 2023 common

This calculates ephdata2023.dat.

Saving cached ephemeris...Done. Restart with the same parameters to calculate common.dat

2. Calculate common datafile
	perl geoCoord.pl 2023 common
	perl gen_amax.pl join 2023

3. Calculate location data
	perl geoCoord.pl 2023 all

Build Astromaximum for Android
1. cd amax-droid/Backend
2. perl calculate_demo.pl 2023 -3 15 data/loclist_vasia.txt
3. Run Android Studio
4. Build->Generate Single APK, select /home/willow/prj/swaxis.keystore, use strong password
5. Rename /home/willow/prj/amax-droid/release/app-release.apk to Astomaximum2023.apk

Build Astromaximum for j2me
1. ./gen_amax.pl notest 2023 ru loclist_vasia.txt -

Build Astromaximum for iOS
1. cd amax-droid/Backend
2. perl calculate_demo.pl 2023 -3 15 data/loclist_vasia.txt
3. cd amax-droid/Astromaximum/app/assets
4. Copy common.dat and locations.dat to Astromaximum project on Mac build machine
